### ⑨ 컴포넌트 가이드

**Button**
```css
.btn { font: 700 14px/1 Pretendard, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
       border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 18px; border: 0;
       display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
       transition: background 150ms ease; }
.btn-primary { background: var(--color-primary-500); color: var(--text-on-primary); }
.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--color-primary-600); }
.btn-primary:active { transform: translateY(1px); background: var(--color-primary-700); }
.btn:disabled { opacity: .42; cursor: not-allowed; }
.btn.is-loading { color: transparent; position: relative; }
.btn.is-loading::after { content: ""; position: absolute; width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 2px solid var(--text-on-primary); border-top-color: transparent; border-radius: 50%; animation: spin 700ms linear infinite; }
.btn-secondary { background: var(--bg-elevated); color: var(--color-primary-600); border: 1px solid var(--color-primary-500); }
.btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--color-primary-500); }
.btn-danger { background: var(--color-error-fg); color: #FFFFFF; }
.btn-buy { background: var(--color-primary-500); color: var(--text-on-primary); padding: 14px 22px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; }
.btn-cart { background: var(--bg-elevated); color: var(--color-primary-500); border: 1.5px solid var(--color-primary-500); padding: 14px 22px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; }
@keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
```

